COMPILATION OF: E46N1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N1

   1 a 0000 E46N1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] THE BARE FILE SKIP, alone in an object.
   4 a 0006      E41X9 refuses this today.  CREATE:41/45 spell it and
   5 a 0006      DR carries it at 01AA-01BD: 12-byte named-file
   6 a 0006      attach, MVI A,01, CALL ?SKPOP, CALL ?QIOOP.  20
   7 a 0006      bytes, and NO item chain. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N1OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) skip;
  11 c 0037   close file(outf);
  12 a 003D end E46N1;

CODE SIZE = 0040
DATA AREA = 0009
FREE SYMS = 38B3
END  COMPILATION
